OL,5,     GInspired by the news that some
OL,6,     GGLP-1 weight-loss drugs are soon
OL,7,     Gto be available in pill form, The
OL,8,     GShrinking imagines a parallel
OL,9,     Gworld where women can shrink to
OL,10,     Gthe 'perfect height'.
